                <h3>Finding a Voice: Farid Ismail on Between the Words (Entre les mots)</h3>
                <p class="dateAesteticTitle2">By Vilpa Films</p>

            </div>
            <div class="col s12 m3"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col s12 m2"></div>
            <div class="col s12 m8">
